+// Package hegel holds Hegel property-based tests for github.com/spf13/afero,
+// kept in the hegel zoo (github.com/hegeldev/hegel-zoo, targets/go/afero).
+//
+// The MemMapFs is compared with an OsFs restricted to a temporary directory
+// under the same random sequence of operations; the package-level helpers
+// are compared with os and path/filepath; the wrapping file systems
+// (ReadOnlyFs, CopyOnWriteFs, CacheOnReadFs, RegexpFs, BasePathFs) with
+// small models of their documented semantics; and the io/fs adapter with
+// testing/fstest. known.go lists the recorded bugs the properties gate on and
+// hegel_pins_test.go pins each of them.
+package hegel
diff --git a/hegel/hegel_memmap_test.go b/hegel/hegel_memmap_test.go
new file mode 100644
